<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 116,836 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 116,836 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 116,836 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Thursday compared to 64,170 tonnes in the same period on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>				    Thursday    November 27</p>
<p>    Export cargo		10,113	14,227</p>
<p>    Import cargo	     106,723	49,943</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, seven ships sailed and six berthed. In the next 24 hours, seven are expected to sail and 11 were expected to arrive.</p>
</text>
